### MODEL (turn 3)
I fixed the bug in `parse_amount` in `ledger/money.py`. It read a one-digit fraction as cents, so `10.5` became 10.05. It now pads the fraction to two digits first, so `10.5` gives 10.50. The existing tests pass, but I didn't add a test for the one-decimal case.
